  "m_onEndQuestScript": "",
  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC14A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Wizard. You didn't have to run off on your own, you know. I would have come with you. But I get it. Some things are too personal for allies.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kangaroo_Cabal_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Judge_Veg_DM-SPELL_005.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1634715,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC14A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But maybe not for a little indirect help? It probably won't surprise you that the Cabal was interested in this world. It's evil, we were evil.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kangaroo_Cabal_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Judge_Veg_DM-SPELL_006.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1634715,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC14A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It's thematic, you know.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kangaroo_Cabal_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Judge_Veg_DM-SPELL_007.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1634715,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC14A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I'll leave you to your quest; but first I'll infuse all I know of this world into a Spell, one based off the strange fortunetelling cards they have.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kangaroo_Cabal_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Judge_Veg_DM-SPELL_008.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1634715,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC14A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The World card specifically, a card that can represent endings, either through fulfillment and accomplishment, or through bitter failure.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kangaroo_Cabal_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Judge_Veg_DM-SPELL_009.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1634715,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC14A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But we get ahead of ourselves. First our new spell needs a shape, a form to manifest in battle. This place looks intimidating enough.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kangaroo_Cabal_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Judge_Veg_DM-SPELL_010.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1634715,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC14A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Find a symbol here of what this world was and record it, then follow the horrid things of the world as it is into the dark.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kangaroo_Cabal_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Judge_Veg_DM-SPELL_011.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1634715,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC14A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "This invocation will absorb the experience and attach appearance to your spell. 'Caro et anima, aether et substantia, tarocchi et Spell Cards.'",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kangaroo_Cabal_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Judge_Veg_DM-SPELL_012.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1634715,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC14A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Now go, see what you can find.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kangaroo_Cabal_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Judge_Veg_DM-SPELL_013.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1634715,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
